WEBVTT

00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:08.848
Friendship and bravery.
And, Harry, just be careful.

00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:48.596
You?

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:53.226
No, it can't be.
Snape, he was the...

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:56.479
Quirrell: Yes, he does seem the type,
doesn't he?

00:00:56.646 --> 00:00:59.816
Next to him, who would suspect...

00:01:00.024 --> 00:01:03.945
Poor, stuttering
professor quirrell?

00:01:04.153 --> 00:01:09.534
But that day, during the Quidditch
match, Snape tried to kill me.

00:01:09.742 --> 00:01:12.537
No, dear boy. I tried to kill you!

00:01:13.037 --> 00:01:17.166
If Snape's cloak hadn't caught
fire and broken my eye contact...

00:01:17.417 --> 00:01:19.627
I would have succeeded.

00:01:19.836 --> 00:01:22.839
Even with Snape muttering
his countercurse.

00:01:23.047 --> 00:01:25.258
Snape was trying to save me?

00:01:25.466 --> 00:01:30.805
I knew you were a danger to me,
especially after Halloween.

00:01:31.013 --> 00:01:35.268
- Then you let the troll in!
- Very good, Potter, yes.

00:01:35.476 --> 00:01:38.479
Snape, unfortunately, wasn't fooled.

00:01:39.063 --> 00:01:44.026
While everyone ran about, he went
to the third floor to head me off.

00:01:44.944 --> 00:01:48.448
He, of course, never trusted me again.

00:01:49.449 --> 00:01:54.704
He rarely left me alone.
But he doesn't understand.

00:01:54.871 --> 00:01:58.958
I'm never alone. Never.

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:03.212
Now, what does this mirror do?

00:02:04.839 --> 00:02:06.966
I see what I desire.

00:02:07.508 --> 00:02:11.888
I see myself holding the stone.
But how do I get it?

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:14.307
Man: Use the boy.

00:02:15.099 --> 00:02:19.020
Come here, Potter! Now!

00:02:31.115 --> 00:02:35.119
Tell me, what do you see?

00:03:00.269 --> 00:03:02.688
What is it? What do you see?

00:03:02.897 --> 00:03:08.069
I'm shaking hands with Dumbledore.
I've won the house cup.

00:03:08.277 --> 00:03:09.779
Man: He lies.

00:03:10.279 --> 00:03:14.033
Tell the truth! What do you see?

00:03:14.242 --> 00:03:18.621
- Man: Let me speak to him.
- Master, you are not strong enough.
